@startuml hosting_activity_no_storage
title Hosting Page Agent - Activity Diagram (No Storage Lifelines)
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive assigned hosting URL and handoff;
:Compile prompt with same-content navigation policy;
:Open hosting browser profile;
:Navigate to assigned target;
:Run inspect_hosting;
:Build server/source frontier\nfrom visible controls and handoff hints;
while (same-content source remains?) is (yes)
  :Open or select source;
  if (popup, overlay, or blocker covers player?) then (yes)
    :Dismiss using verified close/control target;
  else (no)
  endif
  :Activate player using exact candidate,\nframe path, selector, or coordinates;
  :Capture screenshot and player state;
  :Harvest network/media streams;
  if (stream URL found?) then (yes)
    :Record stream, protocol,\nserver label, channel evidence;
  elseif (iframe/player URL exposed?) then (yes)
    :Try iframe-local activation first;
    if (still needs embedded specialist?) then (yes)
      :Record explicit embedded handoff URL;
    else (no)
    endif
  else (no stream)
    :Record failure diagnostics for this source;
  endif
endwhile (no more sources)

if (any streams?) then (yes)
  :Return SUCCESS ExtractionResult;
elseif (embedded handoff exists?) then (yes)
  :Return PARTIAL ExtractionResult;
else (none)
  :Return FAILED ExtractionResult;
endif
stop
@enduml
